<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine June producer prices rise 0.4 percent m/m.</title>
<headline>Ukraine June producer prices rise 0.4 percent m/m.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's producer prices rose 0.4 percent in June after rising 0.3 perecent in May, the Statistics Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    UKRAINE PRODUCER PRICES   June 97   May 97   June 96</p>
<p>    mth/mth (pct)		 +0.4	+0.3     +0.4</p>
<p>The ministry did not provide year-on-year figures.</p>
<p>The government has forecast a producer price rise of no more than 14.3 percent this year.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 244-9150</p>
</text>
